        {
          "text": " Kosuhite bala atakanu naka aitapoet naanyunit, bala aitapoet naabu kaany naabunio ŋesi amudiar ere: ekote aitapoeta bala aitapoet naabu kaany koeor Kebar; kebiror ebuburia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.3",
