        },
        {
          "text": " Katema eoŋ atiar, “Okoku loka etuŋanan, na ŋes aibois naka eicolonoka, ka aibois naka aicaketa nuka akejeka, naeboio kidin ka idwe luka Isirael ikar kere. Kwabo mam bobo idwe luka Isirael emunaarete ekakiror lokalaunan, karaida kes, karaida ikabakanakec, kanuka eporokee, ido kanuka atesin nuka ikabakanakec kotoma aiboisiokec nuiceleleete; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:8"
          },
          "items": [
