                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ido arai irumete ileic kanuka ŋun kere nueswamata, kitejenik kes asubunet naka etogo, ka aputoke, ka alomaretake, ka alomunetake, ka asubunetake kere, ka aicorakinetake, ka asubunetake kere, ka ikisilake kere, kiwadik kakonyenekee: tetere ericete asubuneteke kere, ka aicorakinetake kere, ka aswam da. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
