              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Katema eoŋ atiar, “Okoku loka etuŋanan, inera kwanata Ejakait EDEKE ebe: Nu kes aicorakineta nuka etem: kapaaran naiswamaata, ainakinia ainakineta nuicweio, ka abwatanakin aokot. ",
